          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“If a man is caught having intercourse with another man's wife, both of them are to be put to death. In this way you will get rid of this evil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Suppose a man is caught in a town having intercourse with a woman who is engaged to someone else. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You are to take them outside the town and stone them to death. The woman is to die because she did not cry out for help, although she was in a town, where she could have been heard. And the man is to die because he had intercourse with a woman who was engaged. In this way you will get rid of this evil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Suppose a man out in the countryside rapes a woman who is engaged to someone else. Then only the man is to be put to death; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nothing is to be done to the woman, because she has not committed a sin worthy of death. This case is the same as when one man attacks another man and murders him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The man raped the engaged woman in the countryside, and although she cried for help, there was no one to help her.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
